<%- include('../partials/header') %>
  <h1>Mashups</h1>
  <p>A mashup combines data from more than one service into one new feature.
     This block adds two of them to the OT Tech store:</p>

  <div class="mashup-cards">
    <a class="card" href="/mashups/store-locator">
      <h2>1 &middot; Store locator</h2>
      <p>Our store locations on an <strong>OpenStreetMap</strong> map (Leaflet),
         with <strong>live weather</strong> at each store from the Open-Meteo API.</p>
      <p class="sources">Sources: OpenStreetMap tiles + Open-Meteo weather + our store data</p>
    </a>
    <a class="card" href="/mashups/pricing">
      <h2>2 &middot; International pricing</h2>
      <p>The book catalogue priced in foreign currencies using <strong>live
         exchange rates</strong>, cross-checked across two rate providers.</p>
      <p class="sources">Sources: Frankfurter (ECB) + open.er-api.com + our catalogue</p>
    </a>
  </div>
<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
